(1800000000000000012, 'tangqingye@example.com', '$2a$10$tfxOcwDQ9JEjqxRYhnmiMORf04lbADUfr8UWBKMJyrYkECDYSNo/.', 'tangqingye', NULL, '五年混合开发，Flutter 与原生双修。最近的主业是把 H5 页面在低端机上跑顺。', '移动端开发', 'user', 1, '2026-10-03 09:00:15', '2409:8a1e:7100:c2a0:88aa::3f', '2026-04-08 08:55:00', '2026-10-03 09:00:15'),
(1800000000000000013, 'bailuming@example.com', '$2a$10$tfxOcwDQ9JEjqxRYhnmiMORf04lbADUfr8UWBKMJyrYkECDYSNo/.', 'bailuming', 'http://127.0.0.1:9000/cloudlog/avatar/202604/113c9a81-f4b7-4a65-b2a9-92f35d1e0677.png', '应用安全方向，渗透测试与安全编码培训都做。相信安全左移比事后补救便宜一百倍。', '安全工程师', 'user', 1, '2026-09-18 14:33:51', '113.96.142.88', '2026-04-20 12:14:00', '2026-09-18 14:33:51'),
